  heroImageCredit: 'Secret Desires — Editor\'s Pick platform',
  quickAnswer: 'Grok Ani is xAI\'s built-in anime AI companion, launched inside Grok for iOS in July 2025 and Android in April 2026. She offers voice conversation, a blonde-twintail 3D avatar, and an NSFW mode gated behind SuperGrok subscription. Grok Ani is a fun experiment for existing Grok subscribers, but her memory is shallow, her persona is fixed, and image generation is not a focus — dedicated platforms like Secret Desires still win on depth and consistency.',
